| Variable    | camelCase                | `employeeName`      |
| Object      | camelCase                | `employee`          |
| Constant    | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE         | `MAX_SIZE`          |
| Enum        | PascalCase               | `OrderStatus`       |
| Enum Value  | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE         | `PENDING`           |
| Boolean     | camelCase (`is/has/can`) | `isActive`          |
 